# Third-party agent skills installed locally (samber/cc-skills-golang, and the
# HyperFrames set from `npx skills add heygen-com/hyperframes`). Only the repo's
# own skills are tracked: skills/linctl and .claude/skills/check.
/skills/*
!/skills/linctl/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/check/
.agents/
/agent/
